ne/godot/pull/104478#issuecomment-2745152550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104478","id":2745152550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jn7Qm","user":{"login":"Natializd","id":44465840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDY1ODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44465840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd","html_url":"https://github.com/Natializd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natializd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-22T09:05:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-22T09:05:27Z","body":"@AThousandShips  \r\nIn the Godot source file `godot/io/resource_loader.cpp` (lines 132-136),  ensures that when the resource loader is queried for recognized file extensions, it correctly includes the `.ogv` extension for types related to \"Resource\". This happens because the code checks if the queried type is either empty (meaning all resource types are considered) or if it matches a type handled by the loader. Since `VideoStream` is a subclass of `Resource`, the loader knows to associate `.ogv` with it.\r\n\r\nThe code:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid ResourceFormatLoader::get_recognized_extensions_for_type(const String &p_type, List<String> *p_extensions) const {\r\n    if (p_type.is_empty() || handles_type(p_type)) {\r\n        get_recognized_extensions(p_extensions);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n",